        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Graham Gouldman\n- Bands: Hotlegs, 10cc\n- Albums: Girls, Relayted, The Original Soundtrack\n- Songs: \"Neanderthal Man\", \"Life Is a Minestrone\"\n\nFacts:\n- Graham Gouldman and the artist whose first solo album was Girls were bandmates in Hotlegs.\n- The song that inspired the album Relayted was \"Neanderthal Man\" by Hotlegs.\n- \"Life Is a Minestrone\" was a single from 10cc's 1975 album The Original Soundtrack.\n- Graham Gouldman was a member of 10cc.",
