        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Original Soundtrack, \"I'm Not in Love\", Girls\n- People: Eric Stewart, Graham Gouldman\n- Organizations: 10cc\n- Concepts: singles, songwriting, musical inspiration, tempo\n\nFacts:\n- The Original Soundtrack includes the singles \"Life Is a Minestrone\" and \"I'm Not in Love,\" which was 10cc's most popular song.\n- \"I'm Not in Love\" is a song by the English group 10cc.\n- Eric Stewart and Graham Gouldman, who were band members of 10cc, wrote \"I'm Not in Love.\"\n- An album described in the chunk was inspired by 10cc's \"I'm Not in Love,\" and every song on that album was recorded at 69 BPM.\n- Girls is the first solo album released by Eric Stewart in 1980.",
